<view class="page"><view class="title">实验设备预约</view><view class="muted">使用平台账号登录；注册后由管理员授予设备培训资格。此版本尚未接入微信身份登录。</view>
<input value="{{server}}" data-field="server" bindinput="input" placeholder="后端服务地址"/><input value="{{username}}" data-field="username" bindinput="input" placeholder="用户名" maxlength="32"/><input password value="{{password}}" data-field="password" bindinput="input" placeholder="密码（注册至少 8 位）" maxlength="72"/><view class="error">{{error}}</view><button type="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" data-action="login" bindtap="submit">登录</button><button disabled="{{busy}}" data-action="register" bindtap="submit">注册</button></view>
